---
/**
 * Static stand-in for the 3D map, framed like the scene's map chapter (right half on desktop, top band on
 * mobile), in the first screen only. Shown without WebGL, on software GL, with save-data, without JS, and for the first moments
 * before the scene mounts; main.ts fades it out once the live map has grown over it.
 * The SVG is generated from the scene's own polygon by scripts/poster.mjs.
 */
---
<div class="map-poster" aria-hidden="true">
  <img src="/map-poster.svg" alt="" width="653" height="620" decoding="async" />
</div>
<style>
  /* scrolls away with the hero: without the live scene, nothing should sit behind the text further down */
  .map-poster { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 100svh; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; container-type: size; overflow: hidden; }
  /* camera: 26° vertical FOV at 19.5 units -> perspective of ~2.17 viewport heights; map tilted ~32° */
  img {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 32%; height: auto;
    width: min(93.6cqw, 47cqh);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) perspective(217cqh) rotateX(32deg);
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    img { left: 75%; top: 50%; width: min(45.7cqw, 84cqh); }
  }
</style>
